// NTDS.dit Extraction via ntdsutil or Shadow Copy
// Detects the two common ways the Active Directory database leaves a domain controller: an ntdsutil IFM media creation, or a copy of NTDS.dit out of a volume shadow copy. Either yields every domain hash for offline cracking.
// techniques: T1003.003   severity: critical
// source: rules/credential-access/ntds-dit-extraction.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where (((NewProcessName endswith "\\ntdsutil.exe") and (CommandLine contains "create" and CommandLine contains "ifm")) or ((CommandLine contains "ntds.dit")))
